{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/8bdf826f8b2bf37de476f65d5acfee2d.poster.avif?t=1767803248\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/8bdf826f8b2bf37de476f65d5acfee2d.webm?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/8bdf826f8b2bf37de476f65d5acfee2d.mp4?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge fate in this psychological visual novel about a juvenile psych ward patient who discovers a book that can predict the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Alex, a teenager struggling with mental health, as she finds herself in the middle of a supernatural mystery. There are secrets to uncover in this ward, but putting the pieces together will not be easy. Forge your own destiny in this tale of recovery and finding happiness \u2013 is it true that fate cannot be changed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/7a9f62ab45ba64585e389658cf780f40.poster.avif?t=1767803248\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/7a9f62ab45ba64585e389658cf780f40.webm?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/7a9f62ab45ba64585e389658cf780f40.mp4?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who you want to be friends with and get to know your fellow patients. You can't be close with everyone, and everyone has something to say. Form a meaningful friendship with one person or a superficial acquaintance with three \u2013 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/b4e6694958bad316d55a88814c3feff6.poster.avif?t=1767803248\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/b4e6694958bad316d55a88814c3feff6.webm?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/b4e6694958bad316d55a88814c3feff6.mp4?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An authentic depiction of a juvenile psychiatric ward based on real-life experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 characters to befriend (or not)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mostly linear story with 1 ending and additional scenes based on choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully original graphics, including CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/2152bebfa2c34b346d965ceefd98b1a6.poster.avif?t=1767803248\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/2152bebfa2c34b346d965ceefd98b1a6.webm?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/2152bebfa2c34b346d965ceefd98b1a6.mp4?t=1767803248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021250?t=1767803248","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021250?t=1767803248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/7320b332b18aa01eb2d0ebbaecd96bc00b9cf42a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767803248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/7320b332b18aa01eb2d0ebbaecd96bc00b9cf42a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767803248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing scenes and topics. It tackles themes of mental illness, self-harm, and suicide. Use of alcohol, tobacco, and drugs is referenced, including use by minors. Violence is described. The dialogue contains occasional profanity and references to sexual activity. Most characters in the game are underage teenagers, and all of this content relates to them."},"demos":[{"appid":4239110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/8bdf826f8b2bf37de476f65d5acfee2d.poster.avif?t=1767803248\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021250/extras/8bdf826f8b2bf37de476f65d5acfee2d.webm?t=1767803248\" type=\